2026-07-14/2026-10-26 manually downloaded from https://mainedmr.shinyapps.io/Landings_Portal/ by BTT

2026-1-26 RY used Claude to extract data from PDF annual reports going back decades.

 "Here's where the consolidated DMR landings are as published in the pdfs: /mnt/s1/projects/ecocast/projects/ryoshioka/OceanIndicesExp/Data/MEDMR Landings/2026/DMR_landings_consolidated_2026.csv
 
 A few nuances/caveats:
   - whole pounds and live pounds were consolidated into pounds
   - meat pounds were left as an additional column
   - confidential and fishery closed indications were translated to flag columns
   - These were compiled by Claude after which I did a manual check of 150 randomly sampled rows.
   - salmon from 1990 and on are farmed
   - from 2001-2007, sea cucumber landings are as reported by harvesters, from 2008 and on landings are from dealers"
   
 BTT coped these over to DMR_landings_consolidated_2026.csv.gz